Accessing Graphics
__Accessing Graphics
SimTalk provides the attributes and methods listed in the table of contents to the left for accessing
graphics.
You can view and access the attributes and methods for accessing graphics by clicking Auto Complete on
the Edit ribbon tab of the Method Editor.
See also
Auto Complete
Accessing Graphics
